WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.535 --> 00:00:03.003
- NOW GO--LOOK AT THAT.
- WHAT?

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:04.538
THAT'S AMAZING.
- HE'S SO GOOD AT THIS.

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:05.839
- AMAZING.

00:00:05.873 --> 00:00:07.908
- I KNOW,
LOOK AT YOUR POINTS.

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:10.344
- OH! OH!

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:12.579
OH!
- NICE! NICE!

00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:14.181
- YES. DUDE.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:17.017
YOU HAVE ABSOLUTELY
MASTERED THIS GAME.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.919
- YEAH, WELL, SINCE,
UM, SHEILA LEFT,

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:22.256
I'VE BEEN SPENDING
A LOT OF TIME PLAYING THE GAME.

00:00:22.289 --> 00:00:24.591
- YOU'RE DOING REALLY GOOD.
- THANK YOU.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:26.727
- THAT'S WHY
WE'RE HERE, MAN.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.863
HELP YOU GET OVER SH--HER.

00:00:29.897 --> 00:00:31.899
AND CHECK OUT THIS
AWESOME NEW GAME YOU HAVE!

00:00:31.932 --> 00:00:33.033
- [weakly]
YAY.

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:35.202
- YOU KNOW, I LEFT SOMETHING
IN ANOTHER ROOM.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:39.540
UM, EXCUSE ME, EVERYONE.

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:42.209
- OH, HE STILL
HAS THE SENSORS ON.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.310
[chuckles]

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:44.645
- OH, LOOK.
- IS THAT HIM IN HIS ROOM?

00:00:44.678 --> 00:00:47.481
- YEAH. YOU CAN SEE HIM.
THAT'S FUNNY. WHAT IS HE DOING?

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:50.217
IS HE--IS HE ON HIS KNEES?

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.886
DID HE DROP TO HIS KNEES?
- OH, N--[chuckles]

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.421
- OH...
- THAT--THAT--

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:55.556
HE'S PROBABLY LOOKING FOR--

00:00:55.589 --> 00:00:57.491
- NO, LOOK.
HE'S--HE'S CRYING.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.093
HE'S CRYING. OH, NO.
- HE'S JUST--

00:01:00.127 --> 00:01:01.228
- NO, NO, HE'S SHUDDERING.
- THAT'S JUST SHAKING.

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.630
- HE'S SHUDDERING.
IS HE FETAL?

00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:06.066
YEAH, HE CURLED UP.
LOOK AT THAT. HE'S FETAL.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:08.936
- HEY, CRAIG, BUDDY.
YOU ALL RIGHT UP THERE?

00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:13.240
- OH, YEAH, I'M--I'M--I'M--
I'M COMING RIGHT OUT.

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:16.143
- OH, HE--UM...

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:18.846
HEY, MAN, YOU ALL RIGHT?

00:01:18.879 --> 00:01:20.214
- YES. YEAH. OH, YEAH.
YEAH, YEAH.

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:21.615
IT'S JUST,
UH, MY SINUSES...

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:22.683
[sniffs]
ARE ACTING UP.

00:01:22.716 --> 00:01:25.319
YEAH.
YEAH, I, UM--

00:01:25.352 --> 00:01:26.753
I WAS JUST--YOU KNOW, I WAS
JUST THINKING ABOUT SHEILA,

00:01:26.787 --> 00:01:27.921
AND YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:01:27.955 --> 00:01:29.790
I'M--I AM TOTALLY OVER HER.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.091
- AWESOME.
- AWESOME.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:33.427
- LET'S--HEY, LET'S GET
THIS PARTY STARTED.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.428
- SURE.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:38.098
OH.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:40.567
UH...

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.603
I FORGOT TO GET RID OF THIS
PICTURE OF SHEILA. EXCUSE ME.

00:01:42.636 --> 00:01:44.872
- HEY, MAYBE LEAVE THE SENSORS
SO ONE OF US CAN PLAY.

00:01:44.905 --> 00:01:47.007
[game music begins]

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.309
- OH, HE'S DANCING.

00:01:49.343 --> 00:01:51.812
HE'S DANCING WITH THE PHOTO.
IS HE KI--

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:52.880
HE'S DOING--
HE'S DOING THIS A BUNCH.

00:01:52.913 --> 00:01:54.982
- ALL RIGHT.
- IS HE KISSING IT?

00:01:55.015 --> 00:01:56.116
I THINK HE'S KISSING IT.

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.618
- KNOW WHAT?
I'M GONNA TURN THIS OFF.

00:01:57.651 --> 00:01:59.820
'CAUSE WE DON'T NEED TO--
- YOU CHANGE IT AND YOU DIE.

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.455
HE'S UNDOING HIS BUCKLE.

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:02.789
LOOK AT THIS.
HIS PANTS ARE COMING OFF.

00:02:02.823 --> 00:02:03.891
HIS PANTS ARE COMING OFF.

00:02:03.924 --> 00:02:06.193
OH, GOD.
- YEAH.

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:08.061
- NO, NO, NO, NO,
NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.

00:02:08.095 --> 00:02:09.329
- OKAY, THAT'S HAPPENING.
- OH, NO, NO, NO.

00:02:09.363 --> 00:02:12.099
- MY GOD.
- IS HE--HE'S--

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:13.166
HE IS TOTALLY ON THE BED.
- YEAH.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.168
- HE'S TOTALLY FLAT
ON THE BED.

00:02:14.201 --> 00:02:16.770
- OKAY, WELL, THAT'S JUST--

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:18.939
- OH! OH, GOD.

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.808
OH, GROSS.

00:02:21.842 --> 00:02:22.809
[groans]

00:02:22.843 --> 00:02:24.077
- WE SH--WE SHOULDN'T BE...

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:25.779
OKAY, YOU KNOW...

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:27.314
- IS HE REACHING DOWN
FOR HIS FOOT?

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.315
- I DON'T--
- THAT'S HIS FOOT, ISN'T IT?

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:30.751
IS THAT HIS FOOT?

00:02:30.784 --> 00:02:33.353
- AND COMING BACK.

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.892
- WHEW.

00:02:38.926 --> 00:02:42.262
I AM SORRY, EVERYBODY.

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:46.834
WOULD YOU LIKE ME
TO MAKE SOME SNACKS?

00:02:46.867 --> 00:02:49.570
- WASH YOUR HANDS FIRST?

